# The Race Report (spec 06 §1.4, §1.10.1; docs/BUILDING.md "Input scripts"): a report window
# of its own, 310x420, with the Detail, Descr, Race and Tech tabs and a Close button. It is
# modal over Empires, which opened it: the report keeps the keyboard (Esc closes it, not
# Empires) and Empires behind it takes no click (its Close does nothing) while the report is
# open. Closing the report leaves Empires open and in front again.
# layouts: both
options --quick-start=Terran --seed=404 --open=empires --layout=1024x768 --size=1280x800

wait-window empires
click tag:empires:our-race
wait-window race-report
assert-present item:Close in=race-report
assert-present item:Detail in=race-report
screenshot race-report-detail
click item:Descr in=race-report
screenshot race-report-descr
click item:Race in=race-report
screenshot race-report-race
click item:Tech in=race-report
screenshot race-report-tech
click item:Detail in=race-report
# Empires waits behind the report: its Close and Our Race do nothing.
click item:Close in=empires
click tag:empires:our-race
wait 5
assert-window race-report
assert-window empires
# Esc goes to the report in front.
key Escape
wait-closed race-report
assert-window empires
# Its Close button closes only the report; then Empires takes the input again.
click tag:empires:our-race
wait-window race-report
click tag:race-report:close
wait-closed race-report
assert-window empires
key Escape
wait-closed empires
